{"articleNo":"430063","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=430063&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 출석미달(주의)대상자 알림 관련 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.04.12","hit":"5177","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">출석미달</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">주의)대상</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">자 알림 관련 안내</span> </span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">교무과에서 안내드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일 자로 출석미달자 및 출석미달주의자 대상으로 금오톡톡 안내 메시지가 발송되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">수강 중인 교과목 중 결석시간이 전체 수업시간의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">을 초과하는 경우 출석미달로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">F</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학점 처리예정과목이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전체수업시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">50% </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이상 결석하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전체 수업시간의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/8</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">인 과목의 경우 출석미달 주의과목입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">출석미달교과목현황조회 경로</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">원스톱서비스 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">– </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학사관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">개인별강의시간표 조회 하단 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 94, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">교과목 현황</span></p><p class=\"0\"><br><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전자출결에서 출결상황이 미입력된 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">미출결 상태</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- LMS </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 출석미달 주의 과목이 여러개 인 경우 톡톡 메세지를 중복 수신할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 조기취업자출석인정 승인을 받은 학생이 메세지를 수신한 경우 과목담당 교수님에게 출결반영 여부를 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">출결에 오류가 있을 시 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">해당과목 교수님에게 문의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6913\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul